BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-23T09:22:20&endDate=2026-10-24T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nPiccadilly Line: Severe delays while we fix a signal failure at Leicester Square. Please avoid the Piccadilly line where possible. Tickets are being accepted on London Buses\, Elizabeth Line\, Great Northern\, Weaver Line and South Western Railway.  
